    <h1>How to Teach Your Child Tajweed at Home:<br/><em>A Step-by-Step Guide</em></h1>
    <div class="article-meta">
      <span>📖 9 min read</span><span>·</span>
      <span>Updated September 2026</span>
    </div>
    <p class="article-lede">You don't need to be a Tajweed expert to support your child's learning at home. This guide walks through a practical order to introduce things in, how to structure short daily practice, and the mistakes well-meaning parents commonly make.</p>
  </div>
